#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-guides.php
msgid "Practical guides of ReuSteel in French, Arabic and English (buying reused steel, used steel buildings, ordering bars to cut less, selling offcuts): written in the administration, shown at /guides/ with a table of contents and links to the tools of the site. Frequently asked questions on how the site works, shown at /faq/ and at the bottom of the pages they concern. Methods and how the site works only: no market price, no statistics. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""

